msgstr "Die laaste stoor het nie voltooi nie"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3612
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%zu areas of \"%s\" can't be read, even after repair. Where an earlier "
"version survived in the file's history it is shown in its place; anything "
"else is left blank.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is written to your file until you save. Saving a copy now protects "
"everything that remains."
msgstr ""
"%zu gebiede van \"%s\" kan nie gelees word nie, selfs ná herstelwerk. Waar "
"'n vroeër weergawe in die lêer se geskiedenis oorleef het, word dit in die "
"plek daarvan gewys; alles anders bly leeg.\n"
"\n"
"Niks word na jou lêer geskryf voordat jy stoor nie. Om nou 'n kopie te stoor "
"beskerm alles wat oorbly."

