msgid "Delete Pixels"
msgstr "Skrap pixels"

#: src/ui/tool.cpp:298
msgid ""
"On: discard the pixels outside the crop. Off: keep them (resize the canvas "
"only)"
msgstr ""
"Aan: gooi die pixels buite die snoei weg. Af: behou hulle (verander net die "
"doekgrootte)"

